[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=11 format=3]

; Every control in the game pulls from this. Nothing should ever render in
; default Godot grey.
;
; Palette: near-black slab, one ice-blue accent, desaturated text. Square
; corners throughout — the UI is stencilled onto equipment, not a web page.

